LangGraph Features

| Feature             | Description                                 |
| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |
| Multi-agent support | Multiple agents collaborate                 |
| Shared state        | Information persists across nodes           |
| Conditional routing | Different paths based on conditions         |
| Loops               | Retry or gather more information            |
| Memory              | Maintains workflow context                  |
| Tool calling        | Uses APIs, databases, and external services |
| Human-in-the-loop   | Pause and wait for user input               |
| Streaming           | Stream intermediate or final outputs        |
| Error handling      | Retry or recover from failures              |


